  "creator": "NHS",
  "description": "The first Couch to 5K session: after a 5-minute walk you alternate 60 seconds of running with 90 seconds of walking, 8 runs in all, then walk 5 minutes to cool down. Total 28 minutes 30 seconds. Do it three times in week 1 with a rest day between runs; the pace is whatever feels comfortable. Runs 1, 2 and 3 are identical.",
